1
00:01:12.038 --> 00:01:17.135
Whether your computers ready or not,
there are only 318 days till the year 2000.

2
00:01:17.243 --> 00:01:20.269
A group of corporations concerned
about the problems

3
00:01:20.380 --> 00:01:23.543
related to the Y2K computer bug
have convened...

4
00:02:57.343 --> 00:02:58.708
No. Dont cry.

5
00:02:59.946 --> 00:03:02.710
Dont cry. Hey.

6
00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:05.542
Everythings gonna be okay.

7
00:03:07.987 --> 00:03:11.684
Hi. Everythings gonna be okay, pal.

8
00:03:13.193 --> 00:03:15.684
Come here, come here. Yeah.

9
00:03:16.462 --> 00:03:19.192
Thats a good boy. Okay, dont cry.

10
00:03:22.635 --> 00:03:24.660
She cant hurt you anymore.

11
00:03:25.672 --> 00:03:32.601
Its over. Come here.
No ones gonna hurt you ever again.

12
00:03:52.899 --> 00:03:56.733
My name is Louis Hicks.
Im an investigative reporter.

13
00:03:57.503 --> 00:04:00.028
I cover stories of killers and criminals.

14
00:04:02.275 --> 00:04:04.641
Their lives are dark, without hope.

15
00:04:05.945 --> 00:04:09.779
I try not to let it affect me, but its hard.

16
00:04:14.153 --> 00:04:18.283
-Hey! Gordo! Two shots.
-No!

17
00:04:18.391 --> 00:04:19.585
-Yes, yes.
-No, no, no, no.

18
00:04:19.692 --> 00:04:21.091
-I got to work in an hour.
-Just one, just one.

19
00:04:21.194 --> 00:04:22.786
-No, no.
-One shot, old-school.

20
00:04:22.895 --> 00:04:24.419
-One. One shot.
-There it is.

21
00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:35.701
-To Louis.
-Yeah.

22
00:04:39.579 --> 00:04:41.672
All right, now you do something for me.
Let me buy you breakfast.

23
00:04:41.781 --> 00:04:45.342
Too late. I already ate.
Breakfast of champions.

24
00:04:47.820 --> 00:04:53.122
Hows work? Any compelling
real-life stories I should know about?

25
00:04:53.493 --> 00:04:54.824
Not today.

26
00:04:56.029 --> 00:04:57.018
Well...

27
00:04:57.297 --> 00:04:58.889
Hows work for you, huh?
You working on the book?

28
00:04:58.998 --> 00:05:01.762
Always. Always working, Gordo.
